WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:05.238
GORDON RAMSAY (VOICEOVER):
It's the day of the final cook,

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:07.140
and I should be
getting my fires going.

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:08.141
Good morning.

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:08.942
WOMAN: Good morning, Gordon.

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:09.943
How are we?

00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:11.344
Mrs. [inaudible], how are you?

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:13.046
GORDON RAMSAY (VOICEOVER):
But I have a lead on one

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:16.916
more special ingredient that I'm
told can be harvested nearby.

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:18.318
What is this secret ingredient?

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:20.387
[non-english speech]

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:24.691
She's making a chutney
out of the weaver ant.

00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:25.759
It's a delicacy.

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:27.127
GORDON RAMSAY: Weaver ants?
WOMAN: Yes.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:27.861
GORDON RAMSAY: Right.
WOMAN: Yeah.

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:28.828
It's spicy.

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.029
It's salty, and it's sour.

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:31.030
That sounds like
a unique chutney.

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:31.998
WOMAN: Yeah.
[inaudible]

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:32.732
And where are these ants?

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:33.767
Right up there.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:34.634
That's what we were looking at.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:35.435
GORDON RAMSAY: What?

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:36.569
WOMAN: [non-english speech]

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:40.140
OK, she says that he is
going to shimmy up that tree,

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.575
lop that branch off,
drop the ants down.

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:43.610
Right.

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:45.078
And fill it into
a-- a [inaudible]..

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:46.479
GORDON RAMSAY: Do we
have a rope for him?

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:47.347
This this-- is the ladder
that he's going to use.

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:48.348
GORDON RAMSAY: Ladder?

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:49.682
It's like a bamboo stick.

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:50.617
WOMAN: Yeah.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:51.418
Be careful.

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:56.456
And are you sure that
bamboo is strong enough?

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:58.625
It's-- it's definitely
strong enough for him.

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:01.928
It's not even
tied onto the trees.

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:03.463
Bloody hell.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:04.664
This is crazy.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.032
I mean, really crazy.

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:06.866
[bleep]

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:07.901
WOMAN: There.

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:08.968
He is already on the tree now.

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:09.869
He's on the tree.

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:11.037
WOMAN: He's getting it.

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:11.905
GORDON RAMSAY: Wow.

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:12.772
Yeah.

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:13.907
[bleep]

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:14.908
WOMAN: They know the hills.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:15.875
They know the jungles.

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:17.110
GORDON RAMSAY: Yes.

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:18.278
WOMAN: They're very,
very good at this.

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:19.512
GORDON RAMSAY:
That is incredible.

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:21.281
What a performance,
getting the ants.

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:22.682
I mean, you know,
I'll go to hell

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:24.117
and back, you know, to
get the best ingredients,

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:25.351
but that is a
different ballgame.

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:26.319
- [non-english].
- Thank you.

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:30.824
Good.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:31.858
Oh, gosh.

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:32.759
Watch it, watch it, watch it.

00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:33.993
Get it.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:34.894
- Wait, wait, wait.
- Go, go, go, go.

00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:35.728
Let me come left.

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:37.430
[bleep]

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:38.364
WOMAN: OK.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:39.299
Can you go to the right?
No, no.

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:40.200
Come left.
Come left.

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:41.367
WOMAN: [non-english]

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:42.869
GORDON RAMSAY
(VOICEOVER): I look

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.504
like I'm attempting the most
awkward TikTok dance ever.

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:49.275
[bleep]

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:50.610
Get it, get it, get it.

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:51.411
Damn.

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:56.449
[bleep]

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:57.517
Bloody hell.
- Hold it.

00:01:57.584 --> 00:01:58.785
Hold it, hold.

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:00.019
That bag, you know, and
you're swaying left to right.

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:00.954
Bang.
I missed it.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:01.788
Shake it up.

00:02:01.855 --> 00:02:03.857
Shake it up.

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:05.859
Shake.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:07.227
Damn!

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.529
And then all of a sudden,
they're everywhere.

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:10.930
[bleep]

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:12.265
Man.

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:13.733
And just when you think
you've got the last one,

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.502
you put your hands in your
pockets, they're in there.

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:17.937
I must have been
bitten 50, 60 times.

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:19.706
[bleep] hell.

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:21.708
This is a true ants in
the pants situation, no?

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:23.776
This is definitely
ants in the pants.

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:26.446
[bleep]

00:02:26.513 --> 00:02:27.847
- So there we are.
- Ah, you bastard.

00:02:27.914 --> 00:02:29.048
[non-english speech]

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:30.016
- She's putting salt in this.
- Salt?

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:30.817
[bleep]

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:35.588
Yeah, we're
salting the ants now.

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:36.422
Yes.

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:37.156
[bleep]

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:38.157
- [inaudible]
- Yep.

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:39.459
You got to shake it up.

00:02:39.526 --> 00:02:43.196
Those ants are eating
me before I eat them.

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:44.097
[non-english speech]

00:02:44.163 --> 00:02:44.931
OK, that's enough.

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:46.633
[bleep].

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:48.434
I think I've got half
of the ants in my pants.

00:02:51.538 --> 00:02:53.706
Bloody hell.

00:02:53.773 --> 00:02:54.707
My goodness me.

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:56.209
WOMAN: So we just
pick out any dust.

00:02:56.276 --> 00:02:57.744
Now, these little bits
there, the white bits--

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.245
that's the larva, right?
- That's the larva.

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:00.713
That's the-- that's the eggs?

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.115
Yeah.

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:03.349
GORDON RAMSAY (VOICEOVER):
While most of the ants

00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:05.184
are making a meal
of my nether region,

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:07.453
the rest are getting
chucked into the chutney.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.022
First, you have
to put the coconut--

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:10.223
- All?
- --in the [inaudible] coconut.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.057
All the coconut?

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:12.559
Everything.

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:14.227
GORDON RAMSAY (VOICEOVER):
To make the chutney, we mix

00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:17.730
coconut, garlic, salt,
coriander seeds, and, of course,

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:18.765
chili powder.

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:19.632
GORDON RAMSAY: All of it?

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:20.833
WOMAN: Yeah.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.168
GORDON RAMSAY (VOICEOVER):
Then we add the ants,

00:03:22.235 --> 00:03:23.703
some water, and grind.

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.505
Watch that you don't
smash your fingers.

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:28.908
Yeah.

00:03:28.975 --> 00:03:30.109
[non-english speech]

00:03:30.176 --> 00:03:31.411
You're doing good, she says.

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:36.683
Wow.

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:38.551
Mm.

00:03:38.618 --> 00:03:39.819
Wow.

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:40.687
It's delicious.

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:41.521
Oh, lovely.

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:42.555
GORDON RAMSAY: It's very fresh.

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:43.590
Yes.

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:45.525
Vibrant chutney.

00:03:45.592 --> 00:03:46.893
I love chutneys.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.462
That, for me, has to be the
most fragrant, slightly bitter,

00:03:49.529 --> 00:03:52.532
but with the addition of
that coconut meal in there--

00:03:52.599 --> 00:03:54.334
mm, delicious.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.669
What a delicacy, and,
for me, a great addition

00:03:56.736 --> 00:03:58.071
to my final meal.

00:03:58.137 --> 00:04:00.840
I don't think these ladies are
expecting that from me today,

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:04.611
so a little ace card up my
sleeve, fingers crossed.

